    "backstory": "Born in the icy ruins of Cryo-City, 'Click' Clackerjack had to scavenge early to survive. He left his mom's nest to prove himself as a Drip Raider and discover resources from the wastelands of Subchain City, even if it meant braving toxic storms and rival flocks.",
